{"t":"Bog Water","s":"bog-water-bf4cd","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Bog_Water_49af5d.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Bog Water</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Bog Water\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bog_Water_49af5d.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Flooring<br/>Natural Tiles</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkingspeed\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Tile Friction</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">200</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mapcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Map Color</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ccffff; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 6, 2011<br/>Summer Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20150612140955&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bog_Water_49af5d.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  bog water.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">The water of the bog seems slippery and tries to escape even your clothes.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>The Bog God's temple in <a href=\"#/wiki/Shadowthorn\">Shadowthorn</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33140,32149,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33140, 32149, 7)</a>).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>You can walk on bog water.<br/>Looks the same as <a href=\"#/wiki/Muddy%20Water\">Muddy Water</a>.<br/>This water can be held in a <a href=\"#/wiki/Prepared%20Bucket\">Prepared Bucket</a>, which makes a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket%20of%20Bog%20Water\">Bucket of Bog Water</a>. This is used to put out fires in Shadowthorn in the <a href=\"#/quest/thornfire-world-change\">Thornfire</a> World Change.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket%20of%20Bog%20Water\">Bucket of Bog Water</a></li><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li>Flooring</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Muddy%20Water\">Muddy Water</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Prepared%20Bucket\">Prepared Bucket</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/thornfire-world-change\">Thornfire World Change</a></li><li>Tiles</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Water\">Water</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["thornfire-world-change"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"thornfire-world-change","quest":"Thornfire World Change","step":"2-1","n":8,"title":"Encher com água do pântano","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33125,"y":32147,"z":7,"label":"Templo do bog god (Bog Water)"}]},{"slug":"thornfire-world-change","quest":"Thornfire World Change","step":"3-1","n":11,"title":"Transformar e domar","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33125,"y":32147,"z":7,"label":"Templo do bog god (Bog Water)"}]}],"spots":[{"x":33140,"y":32149,"z":7,"text":"The Bog God's temple in Shadowthorn ( here )."}]}}